# --- Signing keys: NEVER commit a private key ---------------------------------
# The legacy repo committed its DFU private keys in the clear. Do not repeat it.
keys/*-priv.pem
keys/*priv*.pem
*.priv.pem
private_*.pem
# Public keys ARE tracked on purpose (keys/*-pub.pem, keys/*-pub.c).

# --- West / Zephyr workspace ---------------------------------------------------
# The west workspace lives OUTSIDE this repo (as a sibling), so its directories
# need no rules here. They are anchored with a leading slash anyway, so that a
# stray `west init` inside the repo is still ignored -- and, crucially, so they
# cannot shadow our own directories.
#
# An unanchored `tools/` here previously matched our tools/ and silently kept the
# entire verification suite untracked. Anchor workspace paths; never bare names
# that collide with project directories.
.west/
/build/
build-*/
twister-out*/
/modules/
/zephyr/
/bootloader/
/nrf/
/nrfxlib/

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editors / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
